localtest: the links the SPA builds follow the page's origin on the stack (plain http on am.ui.<host>): the platform
(login, logout) and the start page on <host>, the inbox on af.<host>, its own base (changeandredirect, the start page) on
am.ui.<host>, the port kept. Upstream maps every host it does not know (not tt02, at22, at23, yt01) to production, so
switching party and logging out went to am.ui.altinn.no and platform.altinn.no. Deployed environments are https and keep
upstream's code; the info portal's help and news links stay production's.
